  "title": "Extended Tax Audit and ITR Deadlines for 2026-27",
  "summary": "The Indian Tax Department extended the filing deadlines for tax audit reports and ITR submissions by 21 days to 2026-27, allowing corporates to file their returns by November 21 instead of October 31. This extension aims to accommodate the compressed audit window following the August 31 deadline for non-audit cases.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Indian Tax Department extended the due date for tax audit reports and ITR filing by 21 days to November 21.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Corporates will now file their income tax returns for AY'27 by November 21.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The extension was requested by tax practitioners citing the compressed audit window following the August 31 deadline.",
      "confidence": 0.95
